 "cells": [
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# Q-Mini — Google Colab Initial Brain Builder (Build Only)\n\nThis notebook builds the **untrained, random-initialized Q-Mini model** and stores a verified Q2-v2 artifact in Google Drive.\n\n- Default preset: `configs/qmini_light_0.7m.json` (the repository's 0.7M-class configuration).\n- Architecture remains attention-free: causal depthwise convolution + gated diagonal state-space path + sparse Top-1 MoE.\n- Matrix weights are exported in the project's Q2-v2 two-bit format. Row scales and one-dimensional parameters use their documented separate formats.\n- **No dataset is loaded. No tokenizer is trained. No optimizer is created. No training or optimizer step is run.**\n- The build is streamed on CPU by the repository's existing `qmini build-initial` implementation. A Colab GPU is not used by this build stage.\n\nThe output is an initial model artifact, **not yet a capable trained assistant**. Training is a separate future phase. This 0.7M profile is the lightweight development target. The original 5B configuration is kept only as a reference in the separate Q-Mini project.\n\nRun cells from top to bottom. This notebook never overwrites an existing Drive build."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# -------- Build settings (edit before running) --------\nMODEL_CONFIG = \"configs/qmini_light_0.7m.json\"\nDRIVE_SUBFOLDER = \"QMini-Light-0.7M/initial_brains\"\nREPOSITORY_URL = \"https://github.com/lion36508/Q-mini-light-0.7M.git\"\n\n# For a smaller pipeline smoke build, you may choose:\n# MODEL_CONFIG = \"configs/qmini_research_152m.json\"\n\nprint(\"Selected model configuration:\", MODEL_CONFIG)\nprint(\"Build mode: INITIALIZATION ONLY — TRAINING DISABLED\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# -------- Mount Google Drive and obtain a clean source checkout --------\n",
    "from google.colab import drive\n",
    "drive.mount(\"/content/drive\")\n",
    "\n",
    "from pathlib import Path\n",
    "from datetime import datetime, timezone\n",
    "import hashlib\n",
    "import json\n",
    "import shutil\n",
    "import subprocess\n",
    "import sys\n",
    "import time\n",
    "import uuid\n",
    "\n",
    "DRIVE_ROOT = Path(\"/content/drive/MyDrive\")\n",
    "if not DRIVE_ROOT.is_dir():\n",
    "    raise RuntimeError(\"Google Drive was not mounted at /content/drive/MyDrive.\")\n",
    "\n",
    "RUN_ID = datetime.now(timezone.utc).strftime(\"%Y%m%dT%H%M%SZ\") + \"-\" + uuid.uuid4().hex[:6]\n",
    "REPO_DIR = Path(\"/content\") / f\"Q-Mini-{RUN_ID}\"\n",
    "DRIVE_PARENT = DRIVE_ROOT / DRIVE_SUBFOLDER\n",
    "DRIVE_PARENT.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\n",
    "\n",
    "def run_checked(command, *, cwd=None, capture_output=False):\n",
    "    print(\"$\", \" \".join(str(part) for part in command))\n",
    "    return subprocess.run(\n",
    "        [str(part) for part in command],\n",
    "        cwd=str(cwd) if cwd else None,\n",
    "        check=True,\n",
    "        text=True,\n",
    "        capture_output=capture_output,\n",
    "    )\n",
    "\n",
    "run_checked([\n",
    "    \"git\", \"clone\", \"--depth\", \"1\", \"--branch\", \"main\",\n",
    "    REPOSITORY_URL, REPO_DIR\n",
    "])\n",
    "SOURCE_REVISION = run_checked(\n",
    "    [\"git\", \"rev-parse\", \"HEAD\"], cwd=REPO_DIR, capture_output=True\n",
    ").stdout.strip()\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"Source revision:\", SOURCE_REVISION)\n",
    "print(\"Local source:\", REPO_DIR)\n",
    "print(\"Drive destination parent:\", DRIVE_PARENT)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# -------- Install the repository and run a resource preflight --------\n",
    "# The repository's declared dependencies are installed from its pyproject.toml.\n",
    "run_checked([sys.executable, \"-m\", \"pip\", \"install\", \"-e\", \".\"], cwd=REPO_DIR)\n",
    "\n",
    "import torch\n",
    "from qmini.config import QMiniConfig\n",
    "\n",
    "CONFIG_PATH = REPO_DIR / MODEL_CONFIG\n",
    "if not CONFIG_PATH.is_file():\n",
    "    raise FileNotFoundError(f\"Model config does not exist: {CONFIG_PATH}\")\n",
    "\n",
    "cfg = QMiniConfig.from_json(CONFIG_PATH)\n",
    "plan_proc = run_checked(\n",
    "    [sys.executable, \"-m\", \"qmini.cli\", \"plan\", \"--config\", MODEL_CONFIG],\n",
    "    cwd=REPO_DIR,\n",
    "    capture_output=True,\n",
    ")\n",
    "PLAN = json.loads(plan_proc.stdout)\n",
    "\n",
    "GIB = 1024 ** 3\n",
    "# The builder constructs one QMiniBlock at a time. Estimate the largest block\n",
    "# from the same parameter layout used by QMiniConfig, then reserve extra headroom\n",
    "# for tensor conversion, packing buffers, Python and the Colab runtime.\n",
    "d, h, experts = cfg.d_model, cfg.d_hidden, cfg.n_experts\n",
    "router = d * experts + experts if experts > 1 else 0\n",
    "router_norm = d if experts > 1 else 0\n",
    "shared = 3*d*d + 6*d + d*cfg.kernel_size + router_norm + router\n",
    "if cfg.use_state_space:\n",
    "    shared += 4*d*d + 5*d\n",
    "one_expert = 2*d*h + h + d\n",
    "largest_block_parameters = shared + experts*one_expert\n",
    "largest_block_fp32_bytes = largest_block_parameters * 4\n",
    "minimum_available_ram = max(3*GIB, int(2.2*largest_block_fp32_bytes + 2*GIB))\n",
    "\n",
    "try:\n",
    "    import psutil\n",
    "    memory = psutil.virtual_memory()\n",
    "    available_ram = int(memory.available)\n",
    "    total_ram = int(memory.total)\n",
    "except Exception:\n",
    "    meminfo = {}\n",
    "    with open(\"/proc/meminfo\", \"r\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as handle:\n",
    "        for line in handle:\n",
    "            key, value = line.split(\":\", 1)\n",
    "            meminfo[key] = int(value.strip().split()[0]) * 1024\n",
    "    available_ram = meminfo.get(\"MemAvailable\", 0)\n",
    "    total_ram = meminfo.get(\"MemTotal\", 0)\n",
    "\n",
    "estimated_artifact_bytes = int(PLAN[\"estimated_q2_fp16_export_bytes\"])\n",
    "local_free_bytes = shutil.disk_usage(\"/content\").free\n",
    "required_local_disk = estimated_artifact_bytes + int(0.75*GIB)\n",
    "\n",
    "if available_ram < minimum_available_ram:\n",
    "    raise RuntimeError(\n",
    "        \"Build stopped before allocation: available RAM is below the conservative \"\n",
    "        f\"preflight threshold. Available={available_ram/GIB:.2f} GiB; \"\n",
    "        f\"required≈{minimum_available_ram/GIB:.2f} GiB. Select a higher-RAM Colab runtime \"\n",
    "        \"or use the smaller research config. No training has started.\"\n",
    "    )\n",
    "if local_free_bytes < required_local_disk:\n",
    "    raise RuntimeError(\n",
    "        \"Build stopped before writing: insufficient /content disk space. \"\n",
    "        f\"Available={local_free_bytes/GIB:.2f} GiB; \"\n",
    "        f\"required≈{required_local_disk/GIB:.2f} GiB.\"\n",
    "    )\n",
    "\n",
    "try:\n",
    "    drive_free_bytes = shutil.disk_usage(DRIVE_ROOT).free\n",
    "    if drive_free_bytes < estimated_artifact_bytes + int(0.25*GIB):\n",
    "        raise RuntimeError(\n",
    "            \"Google Drive reports insufficient free space for the estimated artifact. \"\n",
    "            \"Free space or choose a smaller config before building.\"\n",
    "        )\n",
    "except OSError as exc:\n",
    "    drive_free_bytes = None\n",
    "    print(\"Drive free-space query unavailable; copy stage will still be verified:\", exc)\n",
    "\n",
    "gpu_name = torch.cuda.get_device_name(0) if torch.cuda.is_available() else \"No GPU attached\"\n",
    "preflight = {\n",
    "    \"config\": MODEL_CONFIG,\n",
    "    \"parameters\": cfg.estimated_parameter_count(),\n",
    "    \"estimated_q2_export_bytes\": estimated_artifact_bytes,\n",
    "    \"largest_streamed_block_fp32_gib\": round(largest_block_fp32_bytes/GIB, 3),\n",
    "    \"available_ram_gib\": round(available_ram/GIB, 2),\n",
    "    \"total_ram_gib\": round(total_ram/GIB, 2),\n",
    "    \"minimum_available_ram_gib\": round(minimum_available_ram/GIB, 2),\n",
    "    \"local_disk_free_gib\": round(local_free_bytes/GIB, 2),\n",
    "    \"drive_disk_free_gib\": round(drive_free_bytes/GIB, 2) if drive_free_bytes is not None else None,\n",
    "    \"colab_gpu\": gpu_name,\n",
    "    \"build_device\": \"CPU streaming (by design)\",\n",
    "    \"training_enabled\": False,\n",
    "}\n",
    "print(json.dumps(preflight, indent=2))\n",
    "print(\"Architecture flags: state-space =\", cfg.use_state_space, \"| attention/QKV = absent by design\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# -------- Build the untrained Q2-v2 initial model locally --------\n",
    "# This command calls only qmini build-initial. It does not invoke qmini train.\n",
    "LOCAL_BUILD_DIR = Path(\"/content\") / f\"QMini-initial-{RUN_ID}\"\n",
    "if LOCAL_BUILD_DIR.exists():\n",
    "    raise FileExistsError(f\"Refusing to overwrite local build directory: {LOCAL_BUILD_DIR}\")\n",
    "\n",
    "BUILD_STARTED_UTC = datetime.now(timezone.utc).isoformat()\n",
    "build_clock = time.monotonic()\n",
    "\n",
    "run_checked([\n",
    "    sys.executable, \"-m\", \"qmini.cli\", \"build-initial\",\n",
    "    \"--config\", MODEL_CONFIG,\n",
    "    \"--output-dir\", LOCAL_BUILD_DIR,\n",
    "    \"--source-revision\", SOURCE_REVISION,\n",
    "], cwd=REPO_DIR)\n",
    "\n",
    "BUILD_SECONDS = round(time.monotonic() - build_clock, 2)\n",
    "PACKED_PATH = LOCAL_BUILD_DIR / \"model.qmini.npz\"\n",
    "MANIFEST_PATH = LOCAL_BUILD_DIR / \"model_manifest.json\"\n",
    "CONFIG_OUT_PATH = LOCAL_BUILD_DIR / \"config.json\"\n",
    "\n",
    "for required_file in (PACKED_PATH, MANIFEST_PATH, CONFIG_OUT_PATH):\n",
    "    if not required_file.is_file():\n",
    "        raise FileNotFoundError(f\"Builder did not produce required file: {required_file}\")\n",
    "\n",
    "manifest = json.loads(MANIFEST_PATH.read_text(encoding=\"utf-8\"))\n",
    "assert manifest.get(\"format\") == \"qmini-initial-brain-v1\"\n",
    "assert manifest.get(\"status\") == \"untrained_initialization\"\n",
    "assert manifest.get(\"training_steps\") == 0\n",
    "assert manifest.get(\"optimizer_steps\") == 0\n",
    "assert manifest.get(\"tokens_seen\") == 0\n",
    "assert manifest.get(\"training_started\") is False\n",
    "assert manifest.get(\"matrix_weight_format\") == \"qmini-packed-v2\"\n",
    "assert manifest.get(\"matrix_weight_bits\") == 2\n",
    "assert manifest.get(\"parameters\") == cfg.estimated_parameter_count()\n",
    "assert not (LOCAL_BUILD_DIR / \"model.pt\").exists(), \"Unexpected dense training checkpoint.\"\n",
    "\n",
    "def sha256_file(path):\n",
    "    digest = hashlib.sha256()\n",
    "    with Path(path).open(\"rb\") as handle:\n",
    "        for chunk in iter(lambda: handle.read(8*1024*1024), b\"\"):\n",
    "            digest.update(chunk)\n",
    "    return digest.hexdigest()\n",
    "\n",
    "LOCAL_SHA256 = sha256_file(PACKED_PATH)\n",
    "assert LOCAL_SHA256 == manifest.get(\"packed_export_sha256\"), \"Local artifact SHA-256 mismatch.\"\n",
    "\n",
    "verify_proc = run_checked(\n",
    "    [sys.executable, \"-m\", \"qmini.cli\", \"verify-export\", \"--path\", PACKED_PATH],\n",
    "    cwd=REPO_DIR,\n",
    "    capture_output=True,\n",
    ")\n",
    "PACKED_REPORT = json.loads(verify_proc.stdout)\n",
    "assert PACKED_REPORT.get(\"format\") == \"qmini-packed-v2\"\n",
    "assert PACKED_REPORT.get(\"q2_version\") == 2\n",
    "assert PACKED_REPORT.get(\"parameter_count\") == cfg.estimated_parameter_count()\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"Local initial model built and independently verified.\")\n",
    "print(\"Parameters:\", f\"{cfg.estimated_parameter_count():,}\")\n",
    "print(\"Packed artifact size:\", f\"{PACKED_PATH.stat().st_size:,}\", \"bytes\")\n",
    "print(\"SHA-256:\", LOCAL_SHA256)\n",
    "print(\"Build time:\", BUILD_SECONDS, \"seconds\")\n",
    "print(\"Training steps: 0 | Optimizer steps: 0 | Tokens seen: 0\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# -------- Copy to Google Drive, verify the copy, then publish --------\n",
    "FINAL_DIR = DRIVE_PARENT / f\"QMini-{Path(MODEL_CONFIG).stem}-Q2v2-initial-{RUN_ID}\"\n",
    "STAGING_DIR = DRIVE_PARENT / f\".{FINAL_DIR.name}.staging\"\n",
    "\n",
    "if FINAL_DIR.exists():\n",
    "    raise FileExistsError(f\"Refusing to overwrite existing Drive build: {FINAL_DIR}\")\n",
    "if STAGING_DIR.exists():\n",
    "    raise FileExistsError(f\"Refusing to overwrite existing staging directory: {STAGING_DIR}\")\n",
    "\n",
    "STAGING_DIR.mkdir(parents=False, exist_ok=False)\n",
    "for filename in (\"config.json\", \"model.qmini.npz\", \"model_manifest.json\"):\n",
    "    shutil.copy2(LOCAL_BUILD_DIR / filename, STAGING_DIR / filename)\n",
    "\n",
    "DRIVE_PACKED_PATH = STAGING_DIR / \"model.qmini.npz\"\n",
    "DRIVE_SHA256 = sha256_file(DRIVE_PACKED_PATH)\n",
    "if DRIVE_SHA256 != LOCAL_SHA256:\n",
    "    raise RuntimeError(\"Drive copy SHA-256 differs from the verified local artifact.\")\n",
    "\n",
    "drive_verify_proc = run_checked(\n",
    "    [sys.executable, \"-m\", \"qmini.cli\", \"verify-export\", \"--path\", DRIVE_PACKED_PATH],\n",
    "    cwd=REPO_DIR,\n",
    "    capture_output=True,\n",
    ")\n",
    "DRIVE_PACKED_REPORT = json.loads(drive_verify_proc.stdout)\n",
    "if DRIVE_PACKED_REPORT.get(\"parameter_count\") != cfg.estimated_parameter_count():\n",
    "    raise RuntimeError(\"Drive copy parameter count does not match the selected config.\")\n",
    "\n",
    "drive_manifest = json.loads((STAGING_DIR / \"model_manifest.json\").read_text(encoding=\"utf-8\"))\n",
    "if drive_manifest.get(\"packed_export_sha256\") != DRIVE_SHA256:\n",
    "    raise RuntimeError(\"Drive manifest fingerprint does not match the copied artifact.\")\n",
    "\n",
    "BUILD_REPORT = {\n",
    "    \"format\": \"qmini-colab-build-report-v1\",\n",
    "    \"run_id\": RUN_ID,\n",
    "    \"repository\": REPOSITORY_URL,\n",
    "    \"source_revision\": SOURCE_REVISION,\n",
    "    \"config\": MODEL_CONFIG,\n",
    "    \"parameters\": cfg.estimated_parameter_count(),\n",
    "    \"architecture\": {\n",
    "        \"causal_convolution\": True,\n",
    "        \"diagonal_state_space\": bool(cfg.use_state_space),\n",
    "        \"sparse_top1_moe\": True,\n",
    "        \"transformer_self_attention\": False,\n",
    "        \"qkv_attention\": False,\n",
    "    },\n",
    "    \"artifact\": {\n",
    "        \"filename\": \"model.qmini.npz\",\n",
    "        \"format\": \"qmini-packed-v2\",\n",
    "        \"matrix_weight_bits\": 2,\n",
    "        \"bytes\": DRIVE_PACKED_PATH.stat().st_size,\n",
    "        \"sha256\": DRIVE_SHA256,\n",
    "        \"verified_after_drive_copy\": True,\n",
    "        \"verification\": DRIVE_PACKED_REPORT,\n",
    "    },\n",
    "    \"training\": {\n",
    "        \"started\": False,\n",
    "        \"training_steps\": 0,\n",
    "        \"optimizer_steps\": 0,\n",
    "        \"tokens_seen\": 0,\n",
    "        \"tokenizer_included\": False,\n",
    "    },\n",
    "    \"preflight\": preflight,\n",
    "    \"build_started_utc\": BUILD_STARTED_UTC,\n",
    "    \"build_completed_utc\": datetime.now(timezone.utc).isoformat(),\n",
    "    \"build_seconds\": BUILD_SECONDS,\n",
    "}\n",
    "(STAGING_DIR / \"BUILD_REPORT.json\").write_text(\n",
    "    json.dumps(BUILD_REPORT, indent=2, ensure_ascii=False, sort_keys=True) + \"\\n\",\n",
    "    encoding=\"utf-8\",\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "# Publish only after the Drive copy and its Q2 archive have passed verification.\n",
    "STAGING_DIR.rename(FINAL_DIR)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"\\nQ-MINI INITIAL BUILD COMPLETE\")\n",
    "print(\"Drive folder:\", FINAL_DIR)\n",
    "print(\"Model artifact:\", FINAL_DIR / \"model.qmini.npz\")\n",
    "print(\"Build report:\", FINAL_DIR / \"BUILD_REPORT.json\")\n",
    "print(\"SHA-256:\", DRIVE_SHA256)\n",
    "print(\"TRAINING STARTED: NO\")\n",
    "print(\"This is a verified, untrained initial model. Training must be run as a separate stage.\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## What was saved to Drive\n\nThe published folder contains:\n\n- `config.json` — exact architecture configuration.\n- `model.qmini.npz` — verified Q2-v2 packed initial weights.\n- `model_manifest.json` — parameter count, precision contract, source revision, artifact hash and explicit zero training counters.\n- `BUILD_REPORT.json` — Colab resource preflight, build metadata and verification results.\n\nThe notebook copies to a staging folder, checks the copied artifact's SHA-256 and Q2 archive structure, and only then renames the staging folder to its final name. Existing final folders are never overwritten.\n\n**Important:** the artifact has random initial weights. It is not a trained language model yet. This build does not include a tokenizer or training corpus. The later training phase needs curated, licensed data and a tokenizer that matches the training configuration. The repository documentation notes that the current single-device trainer cannot train the 0.7M profile; distributed FSDP/ZeRO support is still a prerequisite."
   ]
  }
 ],
